		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Magic-wielding grey cobra- women looming eight feet high. Elusive, evasive, striving to charm and beguile.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +3 (2d6 + poison) and 1 spell +3, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charm (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Focus. One target in near range who can see naga is dominated for duration.</p><p></p><p><strong>Illusion (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 11. Create a convincing visual and/or auditory illusion within near. Lasts 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
